.venv/
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
# The smoke-seeder (finding #231, scripts/seed_smoke_stack.py) runs INSIDE
# the image: it needs the synthetic fixture-corpus builders and the
# committed smoke artifacts (threshold / dataset manifest / pack CSV) the
# compose env defaults point at. Everything is synthetic committed content;
# the rest of tests/ stays out of the image.
!tests/__init__.py
!tests/_indexing_fixtures.py
!tests/_ingestion_fixtures.py
!tests/fixtures/smoke/**
corpus/
datasets/
voices/
# voices/ is excluded for its CONTENT (the curated registry + editorial
# records stay out of layers; production mounts voices.yaml read-only —
# deploy/compose.production.yml). But voices is also a PYTHON PACKAGE:
# service/transparency.py imports voices.render at boot to build the
# /voices page, so the module files must ship in the image or the api
# dies at startup with ModuleNotFoundError (2026-09-13 deploy hit this).
!voices/__init__.py
!voices/render.py
reviews/
issues/

# Secrets and private files — never bake into image layers (finding #30)
.env
.env.*
.streamlit/
.claude/
letters/
.secrets
